00:05:41.640 --> 00:05:44.240
The result holds despite higher memory traffic,

00:05:44.560 --> 00:05:46.460
indicating the device is compute bound

00:05:46.460 --> 00:05:48.180
rather than bandwidth bound.

00:05:48.880 --> 00:05:53.260
The observation applies to Q3.6 to 27b class models.

00:05:54.080 --> 00:05:56.780
Edge deploy team should retest their preferred quant

00:05:56.780 --> 00:05:59.860
